    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act(Chapter 460), as amended by theland Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, was givenby me that the Government intends to acquire the followingland for the purpose of constructing Kurundugahamada underwater reservoir under Kandy North-pathadumbara integratedwater supply project.",
